 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "bizNames is a list of names; each name is one or more words of ASCII letters and digits separated by single spaces. prefix is a non-empty word of ASCII letters and digits, k >= 1. A name matches when at least one of its words starts with prefix, ignoring ASCII case. Its rank key is (index of the first such word, counting from 0; the name itself in code-point order). Return the min(k, number of matches) matching names with the smallest rank keys, in rank order. Duplicate names are listed as often as they occur.",
